def eq_69_x(a_mu, k):
    """x = \\log \\frac{k}{a_{(\\mu)}} = \\log k - (\\mu + 1)\\tau + O(\\tau^2)

    Formula f230, page 10, section '3. SUBLEADING CORRECTIONS TO THE ASIAN IMPLIED VOLATILITY', equation (69). Returns the right-hand side (x = …). O(…) remainder terms were dropped. Chained equation: only the first equality is used.
    """
